/*
  PDFRender - shared basic types, fixed-point arithmetic and error codes.

  The core (pdfflt, pdfobj, pdffile, pdffont, pdfpage) is portable C:
  no OS headers, no floating point.  All PDF "real" numbers are 16.16
  signed fixed point so the module needs neither FPEmulator nor VFP and
  runs at full speed on every CPU from ARMv5 to ARMv8 AArch32.

